  "index_test": "in-vitro-only",
  "index_test_evidence": "In this study, we used robust cardiac NAMs to quantify and detect previously uncharacterized cardiac TdP adverse effects of vanoxerine. ... Here, we quantified the functional effects of clinically relevant concentrations of vanoxerine in vitro using cardiac NAMs coupled with noninvasive video-based imaging and MEA platforms.",
  "decision": "exclude",
  "reason": "The study exclusively uses in vitro methods (cardiac NAMs, hiPSC-CMs, MPS, MEA) to predict human clinical outcomes. It does not include any whole-animal in vivo testing as the index test."
